.TH AMTM 1
.SH NAME
amtm \\- statically map AppleScript automation permissions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B amtm
amtm [--input FILE]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads AppleScript source from a file or standard input and builds a static permission graph without executing it.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBamtm --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
